  "description": "Authoritative public-name source boundary: the official homepage https://master.ricette.jp/ top introduction states 中川マスター (Nakagawa Master / pen-name of Keisuke Nakagawa), and its footer ABOUT states Keisuke Nakagawa (Latin letters), マスター as an SNS alias, and MasterJP as an external-media byline. The full Japanese-kanji personal name is NOT_PUBLISHED and must remain null, never guessed. 中川マスター is a published PEN NAME, not an inferred kanji full personal name. The ZEROICHI MasterJP writer-index connection is author-attested for that exact publisher, not a global join to similarly named people. Full structured output contract: https://github.com/Nakagawa-master/nakagawa-theory-archive/blob/main/metadata/person-name-policy-v1.json",
